1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:06,000
Confidant × Mastercard AP4M: an AI agent with shielded XRP
pays for the relay of a private transfer. Live, on both testnets.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:21,000
The agent starts. Nothing is pre-recorded:
every line in the terminal is the live run.

3
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Step 0: before it may pay, the agent proves it holds at least 12.95 XRP in the pool.
The proof goes to the pool's quorum, not to the merchant.

4
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Its previous proof-of-funds credential is removed.
Each signer re-verifies the new proof on its own node.

5
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:43,000
The quorum writes an expiring ConfidantPoF credential (XLS-70)
on the agent's XRPL account.

6
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:51,000
The agent accepts it with its own signature.
Right: the explorer on the agent's account.

7
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:55,000
A private transfer of 1 XRP is built locally.
The relay answers HTTP 402: 0.1 RLUSD.

8
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Decision, no human: price 0.1 ≤ max 0.25 RLUSD,
and the channel has budget left. The agent pays.

9
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:19,000
It signs an EIP-712 voucher with its channel key;
Mastercard's AP4M redeems it on XRPL EVM testnet.

10
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Paid: VoucherRedeemed on the PaymentLedger.
The metered payment is public. Right: the EVM explorer.

11
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:47,000
The relay checks the claim on the EVM and the credential on XRPL,
then forwards the bundle once to the quorum.

12
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Anchored on XRPL: the pool account's memo names the bundle.
No sender, receiver or amount. Right: the pool's transaction.

13
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:05,000
The receipt: signed by the merchant payout key the 402 named,
countersigned by the agent with its EVM and XRPL keys.

14
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:18,000
The RLUSD payout to the merchant runs on AP4M's side.
In this take its settle call answered an error page, so no payout line.

15
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:23,000
Two ledgers, three facts: funds proved, the payment public,
the transfer private. One receipt binds them.

16
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:40,000
Anyone re-checks the receipt from public data:
no key, no log, no trust in us.

17
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:49,000
All checks pass: both signatures, the channel's parties,
the redeemed voucher, the pool's anchor, the credential.

18
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:59,900
Testnet only. The proof of funds is demo-grade: the signers' nodes see which notes were proven.
